.eslintrc.json
# Ensure compiled output IS included (anything not ignored is included)
# The 'out' directory (excluding out/test) will be included by default
# unless explicitly ignored. We have 'out/test/**' ignored, so other 'out' files are included.
# No need to explicitly state 'out/**' if we are not ignoring 'out' by default.
# If 'main' in package.json is './out/extension.js', then 'out' must not be ignored.
# The typical .vscodeignore does not list 'out/' because it's meant to be included.
# Listing src/** is common to exclude the raw TypeScript sources from the VSIX.
